{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "ad12ba03-6026-47d4-8746-33d1bc210c1e",
		"name": "QAssure — Audit Log API New",
		"description": "Complete Postman collection for QAssure Audit Log API endpoints. Verified against live server April 2026.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `base_url` variable to your server URL (e.g. http://localhost:3000)\n2. Run '01 - Login as Tenant Admin' or '01 - Login as Super Admin' first — the token is automatically saved\n3. All subsequent requests use the saved token automatically\n\n## User Types\n- **LTTS Super Admin** (superadmin@ltts.com) — sees all tenants\n- **Tenant Admin** (admin@pharmacorp.com) — sees Pharma Corp only\n- **Regular User** (bob@pharmacorp.com) — sees own logs only via /my-logs",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "48835086"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "01 — Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login as Tenant Admin",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const res = pm.response.json();",
									"if (res.success && res.data && res.data.access_token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('tenant_admin_token', res.data.access_token);",
									"    console.log('Tenant admin token saved');",
									"    pm.test('Login successful', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
									"    pm.test('Token received', () => pm.expect(res.data.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
									"    pm.test('Role is tenant_admin', () => pm.expect(res.data.roles).to.include('tenant_admin'));",
									"} else {",
									"    console.error('Login failed:', JSON.stringify(res));",
									"    pm.test('Login failed - check credentials', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tenant8admin@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "Login as Pharma Corp tenant admin. Token is auto-saved to tenant_admin_token variable."
					},
					"response": []
				},
